# Normalize line endings across platforms.
#
# Git already stores this repository's text content with LF. Without this file,
# a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) materializes CRLF in the working tree,
# which makes `bun run format:check` fail on every file even when the content is
# correctly formatted — Prettier's endOfLine default is "lf".
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` keeps stored content unchanged and makes every checkout LF,
# so the same verification commands behave identically for both developers and
# both AI agents regardless of platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
